8f891c33-0b11-4642-8383-dd6b3a393a89	c0e954d5-1e9f-4d10-8493-3553c873c204	7eb18e23-db38-45fe-91d5-662cc22b5f08	How can I apply for admission?	For this demonstration, applicants can begin by completing the online application form. They should prepare their educational certificates and identification documents. The admissions office will contact applicants about the next steps.	t	2026-11-04 07:47:49.923998+00	2026-11-04 07:47:49.924002+00
6477c6e2-7b89-445a-8364-38321139bcb7	c0e954d5-1e9f-4d10-8493-3553c873c204	70d93075-db06-4cc4-9da0-49bd99c255a0	Where is Northstar University located?	Northstar University is a fictional university used for this demonstration. Its main campus is located in Colombo, Sri Lanka.	t	2026-11-04 14:13:24.272683+00	2026-11-04 14:13:24.272685+00
a6bb8287-b706-4bdf-bb35-c358b4b975d4	c0e954d5-1e9f-4d10-8493-3553c873c204	70d93075-db06-4cc4-9da0-49bd99c255a0	What are the university's normal opening hours?	For this demonstration, Northstar University's main campus is open from Monday to Friday, 8:00 AM to 5:00 PM. Administrative offices are closed on weekends and public holidays.	t	2026-11-04 14:13:25.409431+00	2026-11-04 14:13:25.409433+00
c0e94120-e3e7-4c48-9098-882ae3866d1e	c0e954d5-1e9f-4d10-8493-3553c873c204	70d93075-db06-4cc4-9da0-49bd99c255a0	Does Northstar University have campus facilities?	Yes. The demonstration campus includes a library, computer laboratories, lecture rooms, a student lounge, a cafeteria, and an administrative office.	t	2026-11-04 14:13:26.189633+00	2026-11-04 14:13:26.189635+00
77b9fda4-c431-4b31-b8d2-7e031c53668d	c0e954d5-1e9f-4d10-8493-3553c873c204	70d93075-db06-4cc4-9da0-49bd99c255a0	How can I get information about the university?	You can ask this information kiosk about admissions, academic programmes, fees, scholarships, accommodation, and student services. You can also contact the relevant university office for further assistance.	t	2026-11-04 14:13:26.939867+00	2026-11-04 14:13:26.939869+00
486942f9-8577-4492-9bfa-e78108833a9b	c0e954d5-1e9f-4d10-8493-3553c873c204	7eb18e23-db38-45fe-91d5-662cc22b5f08	How can I apply to Northstar University?	Applicants can submit an application through the fictional Northstar University admissions portal. They should complete the application form and provide the required educational documents.	t	2026-11-04 14:13:27.624121+00	2026-11-04 14:13:27.624123+00
0cd073b5-e5bc-4f80-b5b4-70f4de3e6902	c0e954d5-1e9f-4d10-8493-3553c873c204	7eb18e23-db38-45fe-91d5-662cc22b5f08	What documents are required for admission?	The demonstration admission process requires a completed application form, copies of educational certificates, a copy of a valid identification document, and a recent passport-sized photograph.	t	2026-11-04 14:13:28.33062+00	2026-11-04 14:13:28.330623+00
bfd322e3-5826-4e31-ba73-1e4a6661dabb	c0e954d5-1e9f-4d10-8493-3553c873c204	7eb18e23-db38-45fe-91d5-662cc22b5f08	When do applications open?	For this demonstration, applications for the September intake open on 1 May and close on 31 July. These dates are fictional and are provided for testing the information kiosk.	t	2026-11-04 14:13:29.102154+00	2026-11-04 14:13:29.102165+00
7633d42d-b4fe-4706-b488-a7c04653229f	c0e954d5-1e9f-4d10-8493-3553c873c204	7eb18e23-db38-45fe-91d5-662cc22b5f08	Can I check my application status?	Applicants can check their application status through the fictional admissions portal using their application reference number. If the status is unclear, they should contact the admissions office.	t	2026-11-04 14:13:29.797389+00	2026-11-04 14:13:29.797391+00
faf687d2-ffef-49f9-ac7d-e953367480ab	c0e954d5-1e9f-4d10-8493-3553c873c204	1d665341-46f1-4e76-9f62-75df32596ff0	What academic programmes are available?	The fictional Northstar University offers demonstration programmes in Computer Science, Business Management, Information Technology, and Data Science.	t	2026-11-04 14:13:30.742232+00	2026-11-04 14:13:30.742234+00
e6aeeebc-2ed0-480d-852c-1ae9dfde6ad7	c0e954d5-1e9f-4d10-8493-3553c873c204	1d665341-46f1-4e76-9f62-75df32596ff0	How long does the Computer Science degree take?	The demonstration Bachelor of Science in Computer Science programme takes three years to complete on a full-time study basis.	t	2026-11-04 14:13:31.656666+00	2026-11-04 14:13:31.656669+00
a7af1936-96d7-4b78-9502-e2db7553f837	c0e954d5-1e9f-4d10-8493-3553c873c204	1d665341-46f1-4e76-9f62-75df32596ff0	Are classes conducted on weekdays?	Most full-time lectures and practical sessions are scheduled from Monday to Friday. Individual timetables may differ depending on the programme and semester.	t	2026-11-04 14:13:32.509262+00	2026-11-04 14:13:32.509265+00
c83c6ce1-f1be-4b71-9c66-c8f6f879aa97	c0e954d5-1e9f-4d10-8493-3553c873c204	1d665341-46f1-4e76-9f62-75df32596ff0	Does the university provide online learning?	Yes. The demonstration university provides an online learning portal where students can access lecture materials, announcements, learning resources, and selected online activities.	t	2026-11-04 14:13:33.419617+00	2026-11-04 14:13:33.419622+00
9479378a-58f3-451b-a625-680f5e120c49	c0e954d5-1e9f-4d10-8493-3553c873c204	b879ce30-de2e-4b8a-b075-f735127dc8a0	How much is the annual tuition fee?	For this fictional demonstration, the annual tuition fee for the Computer Science programme is LKR 450,000. Fees for other programmes may differ.	t	2026-11-04 14:13:34.227987+00	2026-11-04 14:13:34.22799+00
c1405318-2a77-48e8-b5c9-d33c46023138	c0e954d5-1e9f-4d10-8493-3553c873c204	b879ce30-de2e-4b8a-b075-f735127dc8a0	Can I pay tuition fees in instalments?	Yes. Under the fictional demonstration payment policy, students may pay tuition fees in two instalments per academic year. They should contact the finance office to confirm their payment schedule.	t	2026-11-04 14:13:35.093863+00	2026-11-04 14:13:35.093866+00
2bbafee4-453a-4643-8832-73e9fdcb5029	c0e954d5-1e9f-4d10-8493-3553c873c204	b879ce30-de2e-4b8a-b075-f735127dc8a0	What payment methods are accepted?	The demonstration university accepts bank transfers, debit cards, and credit cards. Students should retain their payment receipts for reference.	t	2026-11-04 14:13:35.979167+00	2026-11-04 14:13:35.979169+00
48023fef-5482-41e9-a268-71a9b5fbf8c0	c0e954d5-1e9f-4d10-8493-3553c873c204	b879ce30-de2e-4b8a-b075-f735127dc8a0	Where can I obtain a payment receipt?	Students can request a payment receipt from the finance office after their payment has been confirmed. They should provide their student identification number and payment reference.	t	2026-11-04 14:13:36.900347+00	2026-11-04 14:13:36.90035+00
5ce8b613-ae63-49a4-9097-e3dc584797a4	c0e954d5-1e9f-4d10-8493-3553c873c204	029a6842-be2c-4f35-bf3d-1c4693057a4a	Does Northstar University offer scholarships?	Yes. The fictional university offers academic merit scholarships and financial assistance scholarships as part of this demonstration.	t	2026-11-04 14:13:37.780561+00	2026-11-04 14:13:37.780564+00
79862157-0be2-4e94-8f1d-5deae45a2a62	c0e954d5-1e9f-4d10-8493-3553c873c204	029a6842-be2c-4f35-bf3d-1c4693057a4a	Who is eligible for an academic scholarship?	Under the fictional demonstration policy, students with strong academic results may apply for an academic merit scholarship. Applications are reviewed by the scholarship committee.	t	2026-11-04 14:13:38.578782+00	2026-11-04 14:13:38.578785+00
e577b579-dca8-443c-82f4-dc2d5890e544	c0e954d5-1e9f-4d10-8493-3553c873c204	029a6842-be2c-4f35-bf3d-1c4693057a4a	How can I apply for a scholarship?	Students can submit a scholarship application through the student portal. They must provide their academic results and any supporting documents requested by the scholarship committee.	t	2026-11-04 14:13:39.415515+00	2026-11-04 14:13:39.415518+00
80998d5b-f8d3-4050-9363-19f3ce3372e8	c0e954d5-1e9f-4d10-8493-3553c873c204	029a6842-be2c-4f35-bf3d-1c4693057a4a	When will scholarship results be announced?	For this demonstration, scholarship results are announced within four weeks after the application closing date. Applicants are notified through their registered email addresses.	t	2026-11-04 14:13:40.339528+00	2026-11-04 14:13:40.339532+00
2c4f0f67-9ff8-4f37-954c-3c415a8f0e81	c0e954d5-1e9f-4d10-8493-3553c873c204	701e1589-bd0b-4ed5-8cef-2c97575a3464	Does the university provide student accommodation?	The fictional Northstar University provides limited student accommodation near its main campus. Availability depends on the number of applications received.	t	2026-11-04 14:13:41.138922+00	2026-11-04 14:13:41.138925+00
d6ebfb36-1dda-4bbc-a2c5-2d4c53807932	c0e954d5-1e9f-4d10-8493-3553c873c204	701e1589-bd0b-4ed5-8cef-2c97575a3464	How can I apply for university accommodation?	Students can apply through the accommodation office by completing the residential application form and providing their student details.	t	2026-11-04 14:13:42.068202+00	2026-11-04 14:13:42.068205+00
e77e8ab5-3879-4b41-8c8b-4a65f28469bb	c0e954d5-1e9f-4d10-8493-3553c873c204	701e1589-bd0b-4ed5-8cef-2c97575a3464	Are meals included in the accommodation fee?	For this demonstration, accommodation fees do not include meals. Students can use the campus cafeteria or arrange their own meals.	t	2026-11-04 14:13:42.995949+00	2026-11-04 14:13:42.995953+00
8f9e0a31-4577-45c0-bd85-7f873566a1b7	c0e954d5-1e9f-4d10-8493-3553c873c204	701e1589-bd0b-4ed5-8cef-2c97575a3464	Can international students apply for accommodation?	Yes. International students may apply for university accommodation. They should submit their application early because residential spaces are limited.	t	2026-11-04 14:13:43.900807+00	2026-11-04 14:13:43.90081+00
c56381a4-b560-4b8b-b2c8-9d2e8ae16178	c0e954d5-1e9f-4d10-8493-3553c873c204	107b6f7e-7c72-4a9c-960f-366bdbbc543c	What are the library opening hours?	For this demonstration, the university library is open Monday to Friday from 8:00 AM to 6:00 PM and on Saturday from 9:00 AM to 1:00 PM.	t	2026-11-04 14:13:44.693622+00	2026-11-04 14:13:44.693625+00
671d1633-c5b6-420a-9092-7a01bbcf23c8	c0e954d5-1e9f-4d10-8493-3553c873c204	107b6f7e-7c72-4a9c-960f-366bdbbc543c	Does the university provide computer laboratory facilities?	Yes. The demonstration campus includes computer laboratories with internet access and software for academic activities. Students can use these facilities according to their timetables.	t	2026-11-04 14:13:45.440273+00	2026-11-04 14:13:45.440277+00
55238a43-61ed-42dc-a851-85249181e101	c0e954d5-1e9f-4d10-8493-3553c873c204	107b6f7e-7c72-4a9c-960f-366bdbbc543c	How can I get technical support for my student account?	Students can contact the IT support office or submit a support request through the student portal. They should include their student identification number and a description of the problem.	t	2026-11-04 14:13:46.217589+00	2026-11-04 14:13:46.217593+00
cd809be3-61a6-4aa1-9733-4c45bbb42b40	c0e954d5-1e9f-4d10-8493-3553c873c204	107b6f7e-7c72-4a9c-960f-366bdbbc543c	Are there student clubs and societies?	Yes. The fictional university has demonstration student clubs for technology, business, sports, arts, and community activities. Students can contact the student affairs office to learn about joining.	t	2026-11-04 14:13:46.898403+00	2026-11-04 14:13:46.898406+00
59f071ae-5c56-4f1e-91b0-8b7f341dc31c	c0e954d5-1e9f-4d10-8493-3553c873c204	cbe077a6-b1a2-4dfd-b8d5-5c0e3118fa3e	Can international students apply to Northstar University?	Yes. The fictional university accepts applications from international students for its listed academic programmes. Applicants must meet the relevant academic and admission requirements.	t	2026-11-04 14:13:47.746438+00	2026-11-04 14:13:47.746441+00
2b007e33-9f82-42d5-9af1-5a4dc7731bdf	c0e954d5-1e9f-4d10-8493-3553c873c204	cbe077a6-b1a2-4dfd-b8d5-5c0e3118fa3e	What documents do international applicants need?	International applicants should provide their educational certificates, passport details, completed application form, and any additional documents requested by the admissions office.	t	2026-11-04 14:13:48.549146+00	2026-11-04 14:13:48.549149+00
b7764622-769d-43fd-865d-5bbdda0285d2	c0e954d5-1e9f-4d10-8493-3553c873c204	cbe077a6-b1a2-4dfd-b8d5-5c0e3118fa3e	Does the university assist with visa information?	The international student office can provide general guidance about student visa documentation. Applicants should confirm current visa requirements with the relevant official immigration authority.	t	2026-11-04 14:13:49.369652+00	2026-11-04 14:13:49.369654+00
8a258870-1626-4426-b7c5-af50278d42ff	c0e954d5-1e9f-4d10-8493-3553c873c204	cbe077a6-b1a2-4dfd-b8d5-5c0e3118fa3e	Can international students stay in university accommodation?	Yes. International students can apply for the university's limited accommodation spaces. Applications are considered according to availability and the accommodation policy.	t	2026-11-04 14:13:50.248673+00	2026-11-04 14:13:50.248675+00
f96c4fd6-7ca7-4ba3-b5bc-207f1af6b2d8	c0e954d5-1e9f-4d10-8493-3553c873c204	c0577db6-3412-4a73-bdd4-b1d7409d2f0d	How can I contact the admissions office?	For this demonstration, the admissions office can be contacted at admissions@northstar.example. This is a fictional email address and is not a real university contact.	t	2026-11-04 14:13:51.081085+00	2026-11-04 14:13:51.081088+00
c5e70749-38e2-4c18-82bb-99d7037838dc	c0e954d5-1e9f-4d10-8493-3553c873c204	c0577db6-3412-4a73-bdd4-b1d7409d2f0d	How can I contact the finance office?	For this demonstration, the finance office can be contacted at finance@northstar.example. This is a fictional email address and is not a real university contact.	t	2026-11-04 14:13:51.903085+00	2026-11-04 14:13:51.903088+00
7b2f707b-6812-4c4e-81c7-772466370ef8	c0e954d5-1e9f-4d10-8493-3553c873c204	c0577db6-3412-4a73-bdd4-b1d7409d2f0d	Where is the student affairs office?	The demonstration student affairs office is located on the ground floor of the main administration building, near the main reception area.	t	2026-11-04 14:13:52.711611+00	2026-11-04 14:13:52.711614+00
