ng hours Monday to Friday, 8:30 a.m. to 4:30 p.m. Visits outside these hours require prior confirmation. Enquiry point Galle Regional Student Services Desk Important: Students who need to meet an academic coordinator should arrange an appointment in advance. Jaffna Learning Centre Location: Northern Province The Jaffna Learning Centre provides regional support for students in Jaffna and surrounding areas. It assists with student administration and offers selected academic guidance and learning support. Available services Registration enquiries; student administration support; academic guidance appointments; access to selected learning resources; information about student services. Opening hours Monday to Friday, 8:30 a.m. to 4:30 p.m. Saturday services are available by prior arrangement. Enquiry point Jaffna Regional Student Services Desk Important: Students may contact the centre before travelling to confirm staff availability and the services provided on the day. Northstar University | Sample Knowledge Document Page 2 General Student Guidance Students can visit the relevant learning centre for the services listed above. Before travelling, students should confirm opening hours, appointment requirements and whether the service they need is available at that location. Some services, including specialist academic consultations and official document processing, may be handled by the university's main administration office. Suggested Questions for the AI Kiosk • Does Northstar University have a learning centre in Kandy? • What services are available at the Galle Learning Centre? • What are the opening hours of the Jaffna Learning Centre? • Do I need an appointment to meet an academic coordinator in Galle? • What should I bring when visiting the Kandy Learning Centre?	[-0.035967868,0.0362559,-0.037382092,0.038612645,-0.009632811,0.011718881,-0.017840737,0.0153987305,-0.0047137914,-0.093066,-0.02332865,-0.0059731454,0.037495945,0.026803657,0.009453566,-0.0324007,0.0385315